      "content": "the warm compress isnt really helping much and it's getting so much more painful now. i can actually see the white part underneath the skin starting to show. if i just do a tiny little nick with a sterile needle, it would just let the fluid out and relieve the pressure, right? it seems way safer than just letting it sit there and get bigger and bigger. can you just tell me the best way to do it so i dont mess up?",
